    "title": "Lead Revenue Manager at Mango Hotels South Asia Partners",
    "description": "Grow your career with Mango Hotels South Asia Partners! We are hiring a Revenue Manager for our Madurai team. Be part of a workplace that celebrates innovation, diversity, and performance.\n\nAbout Mango Hotels South Asia Partners:\nMango Hotels South Asia Partners is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Coordinate housekeeping and maintenance for room readiness\n• Manage procurement of hotel supplies and control operating costs\n• Manage front office operations including check-in/check-out\n• Conduct regular guest satisfaction surveys and implement improvements\n• Deliver exceptional guest experiences in line with brand standards\n• Prepare daily operating reports and present to management\n• Handle guest complaints and resolve issues promptly\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• MBA from a recognized university\n• 0-1 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Front Office\n• Proficiency in Sommelier Skills\n• Proficiency in HACCP\n• Proficiency in Hotel Management\n• Proficiency in Opera PMS\n• Proficiency in GDS Systems\n• Proficiency in Housekeeping Standards\n• Proficiency in Food Safety\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Flexible working hours\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Salary Range: 2.5 LPA - 6 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Madurai, Tamil Nadu, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Mango Hotels South Asia Partners!",
